...dev-v9.3.0-ls7","upstream":"### v9.3.0 (2026-11-08)\n\n**Fix** A search link that has a query but no indexers (e.g. <code>?query=mp3&amp;category=All</code>) now runs the search with the category&apos;s preselected indexers instead of only filling in the form.\n\n**Fix** When NZBs are proxied, the indexer&apos;s X-DNZB-* headers (e.g. X-DNZB-Failure) are now passed on to the downloader. This makes SABnzbd&apos;s &quot;Use alternative NZB when download fails&quot; and NZBGet&apos;s FailureLink extension work with NZBHydra2.\n\n**Feature** Already downloaded search results are now marked with a green checkmark in place of the downloader icons instead of a &quot;Downloaded&quot; badge, so the row no longer gets taller. Hover over the checkmark to show the downloader icons and send the result again. See <a href=\"https://github.com/theotherp/nzbhydra2/issues/1115\">#1115</a>\n\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/theotherp/nzbhydra2/releases/tag/v9.3.0"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/root","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","NZBHYDRA2_RELEASE_TYPE=Release","DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive"],"exposed_ports":["5076/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/nzbhydra2/builds/dev-v9.3.0-ls7.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/nzbhydra2/builds/dev-v9.3.0-ls7/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/nzbhydra2/builds/dev-v9.3.0-ls7/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/nzbhydra2/builds/dev-v9.3.0-ls7/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-nzbhyd